              <h3>Agile</h3>
<p>Agile Development which is also more commonly known as Agile Software Development, is an umbrella term for a range of frameworks, please see the following video learn more.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
